---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] mt-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-10 text-sm">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-subtle)] mb-3">Calculators</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li><a href="/">Freight Class</a></li>
          <li><a href="/freight-density-calculator">Density</a></li>
          <li><a href="/dimensional-weight-calculator">Dim Weight</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pallet-calculator">Pallet</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-subtle)] mb-3">Rate &amp; cost</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li><a href="/freight-rate-calculator">Freight Rate</a></li>
          <li><a href="/fuel-surcharge-calculator">Fuel Surcharge</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cost-per-mile-calculator">Cost per Mile</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-subtle)] mb-3">Learn</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li><a href="/what-is-freight-class">What is Freight Class?</a></li>
          <li><a href="/what-is-ltl-freight">What is LTL Freight?</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nmfc-codes-explained">NMFC Codes</a></li>
          <li><a href="/bill-of-lading-guide">Bill of Lading</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-subtle)] mb-3">Site</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms">Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--color-border)]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded bg-[var(--color-text)] text-[var(--color-bg)] font-bold text-[9px] tracking-tight">FC</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-subtle)]">&copy; {year} FreightClassFinder. All calculations run in your browser.</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-subtle)]">
        Density-based estimates. Your carrier's assigned NMFC item governs the billed class.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
